<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" dir="ltr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#eaf4fc" />
  <meta name="description" content="Villa Frères Restaurant — restaurant familial à Aïn Smara, Constantine. Découvrez le menu et les prix, réservez une table en ligne et contactez-nous." />
  <title>Villa Frères Restaurant — Aïn Smara</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{
      /* ====== IDENTITÉ VISUELLE — bleu ciel clair + accents dorés "néon" doux ====== */
      --bg:#eef6fd;
      --surface:#ffffff;
      --surface-2:#f2f8fd;
      --text:#15304a;
      --muted:#5c7b93;
      --gold:#c9962c;
      --gold-2:#a97b1e;
      --gold-neon:#ffcf5c;
      --glow:0 0 20px rgba(255,207,92,.5),0 0 48px rgba(255,207,92,.22);
      --glow-soft:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,207,92,.35),0 6px 22px rgba(255,207,92,.16);
      --line:rgba(21,48,74,.12);
      --success:#1f9d6c;
      --danger:#c8503a;
      --shadow:0 22px 60px rgba(21,72,120,.12);
      --radius:22px;
      --max:1180px;
      --font-display:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;
      --font-body:'Inter',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font-body);line-height:1.6;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% -8%, rgba(255,207,92,.14), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, #dcedfc 0%, transparent 42%),
        linear-gradient(180deg,#f2f8fd 0%, #eaf4fc 38%, #f6fafd 100%);
    }
    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
    button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}
    h1,h2,.brand span,.dash-head strong{font-family:var(--font-display)}
    .container{width:min(var(--max),92%);margin:auto}
    a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold-neon);outline-offset:2px}

    .topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;background:rgba(238,246,253,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .nav{height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2px}
    .mark{width:43px;height:43px;border:1px solid rgba(255,207,92,.55);border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--gold-neon);font-size:19px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#123049,#1c435f);box-shadow:var(--glow-soft)}
    .brand span{display:block;color:var(--text)}.brand small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
    .links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;color:#3a5972;font-size:14px}
    .links a:hover{color:var(--gold-2)}
    .nav-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .btn{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:11px 16px;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;transition:.2s ease;background:#fff;color:var(--text)}
    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:rgba(255,207,92,.55);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,207,92,.18)}
    .btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold-neon),var(--gold));color:#2a1c02;border-color:transparent;font-weight:800;box-shadow:var(--glow-soft)}
    .btn.primary:hover{box-shadow:var(--glow)}
    .btn.whatsapp{background:#e8f8ee;border-color:#bfe6cf;color:#146c47}
    .btn.small-btn{padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px;border-radius:10px}
    @keyframes softGlow{0%,100%{box-shadow:var(--glow-soft)}50%{box-shadow:var(--glow)}}
    .pulse-gold{animation:softGlow 3.4s ease-in-out infinite}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ .pulse-gold{animation:none} html{scroll-behavior:auto} }

    .hero{padding:88px 0 54px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;position:relative}
    .eyebrow{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;color:var(--gold-2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:17px}
    .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--success);box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(31,157,108,.5)}
    h1{font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,82px);line-height:.98;margin:0 0 22px;letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:800px;font-weight:600}
    .hero p{font-size:18px;color:#3f5c74;max-width:650px;margin:0 0 30px}
    .hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
    .hero-card{min-height:460px;border:1px solid rgba(255,207,92,.2);border-radius:30px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#0f2d46,#153a58 55%,#0c2337);box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(10,40,65,.35),var(--glow-soft);padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#eaf4fc}
    .hero-card:before,.hero-card:after{content:"";position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(2px)}
    .hero-card:before{width:280px;height:280px;background:rgba(255,207,92,.16);right:-90px;top:-80px}.hero-card:after{width:240px;height:240px;background:rgba(255,207,92,.09);left:-100px;bottom:-90px}
    .plate{position:relative;z-index:1;height:280px;display:grid;place-items:center}
    .plate-ring{width:245px;height:245px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid rgba(255,207,92,.4);box-shadow:0 0 0 18px rgba(255,207,92,.05),0 0 60px rgba(255,207,92,.22),0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.35);display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle,#1a4062 0 17%,#22557d 18% 23%,#0d2740 24% 100%)}
    .food-icons{font-size:92px;filter:drop-shadow(0 20px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4))}
    .hero-note{position:relative;z-index:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,207,92,.18);border-radius:18px;padding:15px 16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}
    .mini strong{display:block;font-size:18px}.mini span{font-size:11px;color:#a9c6dd}
    section{padding:76px 0}
    .section-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;margin-bottom:28px}
    .section-head h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,45px);letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:600}.section-head p{margin:0;max-width:600px;color:var(--muted)}
    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
    .card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .icon{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(201,150,44,.1);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,207,92,.18) inset;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--gold);font-size:22px;margin-bottom:16px}
    .card h3{margin:0 0 7px}.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:25px}.stat{padding:20px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px}.stat strong{font-size:30px;display:block;color:var(--gold-2);text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,207,92,.25)}.stat span{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
    .menu-wrap{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,207,92,.07),transparent);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:24px}.filter{padding:9px 14px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:#3a5972;cursor:pointer}.filter.active,.filter:hover{border-color:rgba(255,207,92,.6);color:#8a6112;background:rgba(255,207,92,.16);box-shadow:var(--glow-soft)}
    .menu-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px}.dish{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:20px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px}.dish-info h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:17px}.dish-info p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.price{font-weight:800;color:var(--gold-2);white-space:nowrap}.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.feature .card{min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
    .reviews{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.review{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:22px}.stars{color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:2px}.review p{color:#345169;margin:13px 0;font-size:14px}.review .author{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
    .rating{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef6fd,#dceefc);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:18px}.score{font-size:60px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;color:var(--gold-2);text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,207,92,.3)}
    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:18px}.info-list{display:grid;gap:12px}.info-row{display:flex;gap:13px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;background:var(--surface)}.info-row .i{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(201,150,44,.1);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--gold)}.info-row strong{display:block}.info-row span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    form{display:grid;gap:12px}label{font-size:12px;color:#3a5972;font-weight:600}input,select,textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fbfdff;color:var(--text);border-radius:13px;padding:13px;outline:none}input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:rgba(255,207,92,.75);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,207,92,.15)}textarea{min-height:118px;resize:vertical}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .map-card{overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}.map-top{padding:20px}.map{height:300px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 55% 42%,rgba(255,207,92,.3),transparent 40%),linear-gradient(145deg,#e4f0fb,#f7fbff);display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative}.map:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:210px;height:210px;border:1px dashed rgba(201,150,44,.5);border-radius:50%}.pin{font-size:50px;z-index:1;filter:drop-shadow(0 10px 20px rgba(21,72,120,.25))}.map-label{position:absolute;bottom:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;color:#3a5972;font-size:12px}
    footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:35px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.footer strong{color:var(--text)}.owner-link{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;opacity:.7;border-bottom:1px dashed transparent}.owner-link:hover{color:var(--gold-2);opacity:1}
    .floating{position:fixed;right:18px;bottom:18px;z-index:40}.floating a{width:55px;height:55px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#1b8b50;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);font-size:24px;box-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(21,72,120,.3)}
    .mobile-toggle{display:none}.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translate(-50%,20px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;background:#173049;border:1px solid rgba(255,207,92,.4);padding:13px 17px;border-radius:12px;color:#fff;transition:.25s;z-index:60;max-width:90%;text-align:center}.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}

    /* ====== Espace propriétaire (tableau de bord) ====== */
    .dash-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(12,34,55,.55);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);z-index:100;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
    .dash-overlay.show{display:flex}
    .dash-card{background:var(--surface);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);width:min(440px,100%);padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
    .dash-panel{background:var(--surface);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);width:min(920px,100%);max-height:88vh;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line)}
    .dash-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--surface);z-index:2;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
    .dash-head strong{font-size:19px;font-weight:600}
    .dash-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:16px 26px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .dash-tab{padding:9px 16px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
    .dash-tab.active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold-neon),var(--gold));color:#2a1c02;border-color:transparent;box-shadow:var(--glow-soft)}
    .dash-body{padding:22px 26px 30px}
    .dash-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface-2);margin-bottom:10px}
    .dash-actions{display:flex;gap:6px}
    .dash-actions button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}
    .dash-actions button:hover{border-color:rgba(255,207,92,.6)}
    .badge{display:inline-flex;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.02em;margin-inline-start:6px}
    .badge.pending{background:rgba(201,150,44,.16);color:#8a6112}
    .badge.confirmed{background:rgba(31,157,108,.16);color:#157a54}
    .badge.cancelled{background:rgba(200,80,58,.16);color:#a33d29}
    .dash-close{border:none;background:transparent;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);line-height:1;padding:4px 8px}
    .dash-close:hover{color:var(--text)}
    .dash-empty{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;padding:20px;text-align:center;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:16px} 
    /* ====== Notifications Admin ====== */
    .notif-wrap{position:relative}
    .notif-btn{position:relative;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;font-size:19px;display:grid;place-items:center}
    .notif-btn:hover{border-color:rgba(255,207,92,.6);box-shadow:var(--glow-soft)}
    .notif-count{position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-6px;min-width:19px;height:19px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--danger);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;display:none;place-items:center;border:2px solid var(--surface)}
    .notif-count.show{display:grid}
    .notif-menu{display:none;position:absolute;right:0;top:48px;width:min(360px,calc(100vw - 40px));background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(21,72,120,.2);padding:12px;z-index:20}
    .notif-menu.show{display:block}
    .notif-title{font-weight:800;margin:2px 4px 9px}
    .notif-list{display:grid;gap:7px;max-height:280px;overflow:auto}
    .notif-item{padding:10px 11px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}
    .notif-item:hover{border-color:rgba(255,207,92,.55)}
    .notif-item strong{display:block;font-size:13px}
    .notif-item span{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
    .notif-empty{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;text-align:center;padding:14px}
    @keyframes notifPulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.08)}}
    .notif-btn.has-new{animation:notifPulse .8s ease-in-out 2}

    .manual-form{display:none;margin-bottom:14px;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface-2)}

    .mobile-toggle{display:none}
    @media(max-width:900px){.links{display:none}.mobile-toggle{display:inline-flex}.hero-grid,.contact-grid,.feature{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-card{min-height:380px}.grid-3,.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.menu-grid,.reviews{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    @media(max-width:600px){.nav{height:67px}.brand small{font-size:9px}.nav-actions .btn.primary{display:none}.hero{padding-top:58px}.hero p{font-size:16px}.hero-card{min-height:340px}.plate{height:220px}.plate-ring{width:190px;height:190px}.food-icons{font-size:70px}.hero-note{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.grid-3,.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section-head{display:block}.section-head p{margin-top:8px}.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.footer{display:block}.footer div+div{margin-top:9px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="container nav">
      <a class="brand" href="#accueil" aria-label="Villa Frères Restaurant">
        <div class="mark">VF</div>
        <div><span>Villa Frères</span><small>Restaurant · Aïn Smara</small></div>
      </a>
      <nav class="links">
        <a href="#restaurant">Le restaurant</a>
        <a href="#menu">Menu</a>
        <a href="#avis">Avis</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="tel:+213781869896">☎ Appeler</a><a class="btn mobile-toggle" href="#contact">☰</a></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="accueil">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Ouvert aujourd'hui · dès 11:00</div>
          <h1>Une table familiale, des saveurs à partager.</h1>
          <p>Bienvenue chez <strong>Villa Frères Restaurant</strong> à Aïn Smara, Constantine. Un restaurant familial avec repas sur place et vente à emporter.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary pulse-gold" href="#menu">Découvrir le menu</a>
            <a class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=7G93%2B7Q7%2C%20A%C3%AFn%20Smara%2C%20Algeria">Voir l'itinéraire ↗</a>
            <a class="btn whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://wa.me/213781869896?text=Bonjour%20Villa%20Fr%C3%A8res%2C%20je%20souhaite%20avoir%20des%20informations.">WhatsApp</a>
          </div>
          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat"><strong>3,7</strong><span>note Google / 5</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>192</strong><span>évaluations</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>1K–5K</strong><span>DA / personne</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>7j/7</strong><span>selon horaires publiés</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="plate"><div class="plate-ring"><div class="food-icons">🍽️</div></div></div>
          <div class="hero-note">
            <div class="mini"><strong>Famille</strong><span>Ambiance conviviale</span></div>
            <div class="mini"><strong>Sur place</strong><span>Repas en salle</span></div>
            <div class="mini"><strong>À emporter</strong><span>Commande à récupérer</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="restaurant">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">L'expérience</div><h2>Un restaurant pensé pour partager.</h2></div><p>Les informations disponibles en ligne indiquent une adresse familiale à Aïn Smara, avec réservation, espace extérieur et plusieurs occasions de repas.</p></div>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</div><h3>Restaurant familial</h3><p>Un cadre adapté aux repas en famille, déjeuners, dîners et moments à célébrer.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">🌿</div><h3>Espace extérieur</h3><p>Des places en extérieur sont signalées parmi les équipements du restaurant.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><div class="icon">🎉</div><h3>Occasions spéciales</h3><p>Le restaurant est signalé pour anniversaires, fêtes et réservations de groupes.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="menu" class="menu-wrap">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">À la carte</div><h2>Notre menu</h2></div><p>Le menu et les prix ci-dessous sont gérés directement par le restaurant depuis l'espace propriétaire.</p></div>
        <div class="filters" id="filtersWrap"></div>
        <div class="menu-grid" id="menuGrid"></div>
        <div class="note">⚠️ Les prix affichés sont fixés par le restaurant et peuvent évoluer. Pour toute question, appelez le <a href="tel:+213781869896" style="color:var(--gold-2)">0781 86 98 96</a>.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Services</div><h2>Tout pour un repas sans complication.</h2></div><p>Les fonctionnalités et services ci-dessous reprennent les informations publiques actuellement disponibles.</p></div>
        <div class="feature">
          <article class="card"><div><div class="icon">🕐</div><h3>Horaires</h3><p>Dimanche à jeudi : 11:00–00:00<br>Vendredi : 15:00–00:00<br>Samedi : 11:00–00:00</p></div><span style="color:var(--success);font-size:13px">● Horaires publiés en ligne</span></article>
